### 注册
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "张三"
}

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 注册 - 测试参数校验（用户名空）
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "123"
