### 发表评论
POST http://localhost:8080/api/comments?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "articleId": 1,
  "content": "这篇文章写得真好！"
}

### 查询文章评论列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/comments/article/1

### 删除评论
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/comments/1?userId=1